====Usage notes====
{{q|Hong Kong}} It may be ambiguous when referring to floors, as both UK and US systems were used in the past. Contemporary usage generally aligns with the UK usage.
* {{zh-x|一樓{lau4-2}|[[first floor]] (UK), equivalent to US [[second]] [[floor]]|C}}
* {{zh-x|一樓{lau4-2}|[[first floor]] (US), equivalent to UK [[ground floor]]|C}}
The second usage is dated, but still commonly seen in older buildings.

To avoid this ambiguity, some may explicitly refer to floor numbers with [[Arabic numeral]]s, such as:
: {{zh-x|１{jat1} 字 樓{lau4-2}|the floor numbered as 1, i.e. [[first floor]] (UK)|C}}
This similarly applies to subsequent floors.

