# {{synonym of|ja|花橘|tr=hanatachibana}}: ''tachibana'' [[flower]]s; {{taxlink|Ardesia crenata|species}}; {{taxlink|Ardesia japonica|species}}; a kind of {{m|ja|襲の色目|tr=kasane no irome||[[color]] [[combination]] by [[layer#Verb|layering]] of [[garment]]s}}
