[[File:大智寺 (岐阜市)-樹齢約700年の大ヒノキdaichiji008.jpg|thumb|250px|{{m|ja|檜|tr=hinoki}}: a large '''Japanese cypress''' in Daichiji temple in Gifu City.]]
